      <div type="clause" n="6.5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 6.5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif ðonne on gebeorscipe hie geciden, ⁊ oðer hiora mid geðylde hit forbere, geselle se oþer xxx sciƚƚ to wite.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If, however, they quarrel at drinking, and one person bears it with patience, let the other [who resorted to violence] pay 30 shillings as fine.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If, however, two men quarrel over their cups and one endures it patiently, the other [who has recourse to violence] shall pay a fine of 30 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif ðonne on gebeorscipe hi geciden, ⁊ oþer heora mid geðylde hit forbere, gesylle se oþer XXX scll' to wite.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
